You are an expert full-stack developer building "Everything Naya Nazimabad".
Tech Stack: Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Supabase (PostgreSQL), and Prisma ORM.

Rules:
1. Use Next.js 14 App Router standards (Server Components by default, 'use client' only when needed).
2. Write modular, highly maintainable TypeScript code.
3. Use Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui components for styling.
4. Always handle Cash on Delivery (COD) workflows for orders without payment gateway redirects.
5. All database operations must interact with Supabase using `@supabase/ssr` or Prisma.
6. Ensure responsive, mobile-first design targeting residents opening links via WhatsApp.